Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:26:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(job-offers): meet the job offer list and delete
 acceptance criteria

- Delete through the shared api client so an expired session logs out (HU7-16).
- Add useDeleteJobOffer and reuse ConfirmDialog with a busy state and destructive variant.
- Rebuild ConfirmDialog on Dialog so it closes with Escape and outside clicks.
- Search titles ignoring case and accents in both lists (HU1-3).
- Use the agreed empty and no-results messages and show Create new vacancy (HU1-2, HU1-4, HU1-7).
- Show skeletons and a temporary error alert while loading the list (HU1-17).
- Reset the search together with the filters (HU1-18).
- Paginate the list ten offers at a time (HU1-16).
- Format the publication date in Bolivia time (HU3-13).
- Restore the empty vacancies service and remove the old delete modal.

